---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="More Solutions & Open Source"
  path="/more"
  description="Open-source software, specialized tools, and lab programs from Northlatch Labs and 0xda7: Hivex control plane, Kestrel Surgical, Sui Move Security Skills, Xlaunch Gateway, .sui names, CTF Range, and Market."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow-pill"><i></i>Open Source &amp; Specialized Programs</span>
      <h1>More solutions &amp; public repositories.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Explore the open-source control planes, vertical clinical software, developer security packs, and emerging beta programs published across <code>github.com/Northlatch-Labs-LLC</code> and <code>github.com/0xda7</code>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="pgrid">
        <article class="pcard" data-reveal>
          <div class="pcard-top">
            <span class="pcard-cat">Agent Control Plane</span>
            <span class="pcard-status"><i></i>MIT Open Source</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="pcard-title">Hivex</h3>
          <p class="pcard-headline">One-human control plane for an agentic company</p>
          <p class="pcard-summary">Single loopback Go binary (<code>127.0.0.1:7891</code>) embedding a React Office UI, broker, provider-neutral inference router, T0&ndash;T3 Gridframe approval gates, and 8 append-only CSV ledgers.</p>
          <div class="pcard-pricing">
            <strong>MIT License</strong>
            <span>Go &ge; 1.25 · enterprise support available</span>
          </div>
          <div class="pcard-actions">
            <a class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" href="https://github.com/Northlatch-Labs-LLC/hivex">
              <span>View on GitHub</span>
              <svg><use href="#i-out"/></svg>
            </a>
            <a class="pcard-link-sec" href="/contact#topic-hivex">Request enterprise setup &rarr;</a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="pcard" data-reveal>
          <div class="pcard-top">
            <span class="pcard-cat">Healthcare AI (Local-Only)</span>
            <span class="tag tag-beta">DESIGN PILOT</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="pcard-title">Kestrel Surgical</h3>
          <p class="pcard-headline">Operative notes &amp; CPT drafting that never leave your Mac</p>
          <p class="pcard-summary">Dictation-first op-note workspace covering 50 built-in procedures with AES-GCM Keychain encryption, crash-safe persistence, and a local hash-chained export audit trail. Refuses rather than guesses.</p>
          <div class="pcard-pricing">
            <strong>Free Pilot</strong>
            <span>macOS Apple Silicon &amp; Intel · 10-min demo</span>
          </div>
          <div class="pcard-actions">
            <a class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" href="https://github.com/0xda7/kestrel-surgical-site">
              <span>Inspect Pilot Details</span>
              <svg><use href="#i-out"/></svg>
            </a>
            <a class="pcard-link-sec" href="/contact#topic-kestrel">Join pilot &rarr;</a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="pcard" data-reveal>
          <div class="pcard-top">
            <span class="pcard-cat">Developer Security</span>
            <span class="pcard-status"><i></i>CC BY-SA 4.0</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="pcard-title">Sui Move Security Skills</h3>
          <p class="pcard-headline">9 Sui-native vulnerability detectors for AI agents</p>
          <p class="pcard-summary">Purpose-built security skills for Claude Code and agentskills.io clients covering Cetus-class arithmetic shifts, capability leaks, shared-object access control, hot-potato structs, and upgrade cap discipline.</p>
          <div class="pcard-pricing">
            <strong>Free / Open Standard</strong>
            <span>Pairs with ProtocolX Verify CI</span>
          </div>
          <div class="pcard-actions">
            <a class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" href="https://github.com/Northlatch-Labs-LLC/sui-move-security-skills">
              <span>View Skills Repo</span>
              <svg><use href="#i-out"/></svg>
            </a>
            <a class="pcard-link-sec" href="/verify">Open Verify &rarr;</a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="pcard" data-reveal>
          <div class="pcard-top">
            <span class="pcard-cat">Model Routing</span>
            <span class="pcard-status"><i></i>Self-Hostable</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="pcard-title">Xlaunch Gateway</h3>
          <p class="pcard-headline">Unified 44-provider LLM gateway with automatic failover</p>
          <p class="pcard-summary">Node/Express + SQLite + React dashboard speaking OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, Ollama, and MCP wire formats across 44 providers with per-key quota tracking and cooldowns.</p>
          <div class="pcard-pricing">
            <strong>Proprietary License</strong>
            <span>Commercial license required for production use</span>
          </div>
          <div class="pcard-actions">
            <a class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" href="https://github.com/Northlatch-Labs-LLC/xlaunch-gateway">
              <span>Inspect Repository</span>
              <svg><use href="#i-out"/></svg>
            </a>
            <a class="pcard-link-sec" href="/contact#topic-xlaunch">License inquiry &rarr;</a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="pcard" data-reveal>
          <div class="pcard-top">
            <span class="pcard-cat">Brand Identity</span>
            <span class="pcard-status"><i></i>Live</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="pcard-title">SuiNS Brand Names</h3>
          <p class="pcard-headline">Human-readable .sui addresses</p>
          <p class="pcard-summary">Give your brand, product, or agent a readable <code>.sui</code> name in one transaction so customers never have to verify or mistype a 64-character hex address.</p>
          <div class="pcard-pricing">
            <strong>$10 first year</strong>
            <span>Standard SuiNS DAO renewal schedule applies</span>
          </div>
          <div class="pcard-actions">
            <a class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" href="https://suivision.xyz" rel="noopener">
              <span>Register via Sui Wallet</span>
              <svg><use href="#i-out"/></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="pcard" data-reveal>
          <div class="pcard-top">
            <span class="pcard-cat">Security Training</span>
            <span class="tag tag-beta">BETA</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="pcard-title">CTF Security Range</h3>
          <p class="pcard-headline">Train engineers on real Move exploits</p>
          <p class="pcard-summary">Eight realistic smart-contract security challenges running against a retired mainnet deployment &mdash; built for engineering teams hardening Move codebases.</p>
          <div class="pcard-pricing">
            <strong>Free in Beta</strong>
            <span>Request team access via contact</span>
          </div>
          <div class="pcard-actions">
            <a class="btn btn-outline btn-sm" href="/contact#topic-range">Request Beta Access &rarr;</a>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="card" style="margin-top:32px" data-reveal>
        <div class="top">
          <h3>Autonomous Work Market (In Build) &amp; Complete GitHub Directory</h3>
          <span class="tag tag-beta">EARLY ACCESS</span>
        </div>
        <p>We are also building an agentic task marketplace where vetted AI workers complete scoped deliverables and receive payment upon verification, alongside our open citizen harnesses (<code>labs</code>, <code>labs-sibling</code>) and MCP server (<code>weir-protocol</code>).</p>
        <div class="actions" style="margin-top:20px">
          <a class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" href="/contact#topic-sales">Request Early Access</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" href="https://github.com/Northlatch-Labs-LLC">Northlatch Org &#8599;</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" href="https://github.com/0xda7">0xda7 GitHub &#8599;</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
